i3-rs — a 1:1 Rust port of i3 4.25
===================================

This project is a Rust re-implementation of the i3 window manager,
version 4.25 (upstream commit 8a97b0f). It contains no C code from i3 and
does not link against libi3; every ported function is marked with a
`// C: src/foo.c:123` comment pointing at the original statement.

Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

third_party/i3/parser-specs/{commands,config}.spec
third_party/i3/tools/generate-command-parser.pl
third_party/i3/LICENSE

    Verbatim copies from i3 4.25, used as the single source of truth for the
    generated command/config parsers. Copyright © 2009 Michael Stapelberg and
    contributors, licensed under the BSD 3-Clause license (see
    third_party/i3/LICENSE).

    These files are vendored only so that `cargo build` works from a plain
    checkout; the Rust build script (crates/i3-spec/build.rs) is a direct
    port of generate-command-parser.pl and reads them unchanged. Set I3_SRC
    to a full i3 source tree to build against that copy instead.

